    "description": {
      "zh": "纯硅专用 NEP4 三体示例权重，经固定 NEP_CPU 1.4 原生 C++ 引擎进行 CPU 单点与固定晶胞 FIRE；未知独立 DFT 误差。",
      "en": "Pure-silicon NEP4 3-body tutorial checkpoint evaluated by pinned native NEP_CPU 1.4 C++ for CPU single points and fixed-cell FIRE; independent DFT error unknown."
    },
    "examples": [
      {
        "zh": "对内置 si-diamond 用硅专用 NEP 做探索单点，输出能量、逐原子力和拉伸为正的应力，展示 3D。",
        "en": "Run an exploratory Si NEP single point on bundled si-diamond; return energy, per-atom forces and positive-tension stress with 3D."
      },
      {
        "zh": "对扰动的纯硅周期结构用此 NEP 固定晶胞 FIRE，最多100步，fmax 0.05 eV/Å；报告真实收敛状态及前后对比。",
        "en": "Use this NEP for fixed-cell FIRE on a perturbed pure-Si periodic structure, up to 100 steps at fmax 0.05 eV/Å; report actual convergence and before/after comparison."
      }
    ],
    "limitations": [
      {
        "zh": "仅纯硅三维周期探索；最多256原子，晶胞最小奇异值≥4 Å，体积/原子≥5 Å³。不开放其他元素、显式电荷/自旋、变胞、MD、GPU、长程或额外D3。",
        "en": "Pure Si 3D periodic screening only: <=256 atoms, minimum cell singular value >=4 Å and volume/atom >=5 Å³. Other elements, charge/spin, variable cell, MD, GPU, long-range and added D3 are not approved."
      },
      {
        "zh": "来源为 GPUMD 示例权重；README 旧 NEP3 名称与本文件 NEP4 头不同，记录具体文件身份。无独立 DFT 精度或训练重叠验证。",
        "en": "GPUMD tutorial artifact: historical README uses NEP3 names while this pinned file has a NEP4 header. Exact file identity is recorded. No independent DFT accuracy or training-overlap validation."
      }
    ],
